    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "playmusic",
        "params": {
            "intro": "$nervous_intro",
            "key": "$nervous_loop",
            "volume": 0.4
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#1",
            "fadetime": 0.7
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 0.7
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Colonel Hamilton",
        "text": "Skamandros."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Horn",
        "text": "Colonel."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Colonel Hamilton",
        "text": "I once saw your father\u2014over twenty years ago, at a ball the Duke of Caster was holding. Of course, I was still a bottom-rung guard then, so all I had was a glimpse from afar at the White Wolf Count of legend."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Colonel Hamilton",
        "text": "Not long after, I heard a deformed feathered reptile struck illness into him at a Londinium beastlife garden, and he quickly took leave from the aristocratic circles."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Colonel Hamilton",
        "text": "Ever since, he hasn't taken a step beyond his manor at Portsmouth City."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Colonel Hamilton",
        "text": "Is your father still in fine spirits?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Horn",
        "text": "Thank you for your concern, and I hope reminiscing over these years-old affairs hasn't eaten up too much of your precious time. After all, meeting with you doesn't prove easy."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Colonel Hamilton",
        "text": "You don't resemble your father."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Horn",
        "text": "As is clear, my father did not have the opportunity to serve for the Empire's Army like you or I do."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Horn",
        "text": "Considering the theft of these military Originium goods couldn't possibly relate to him, maybe we don't have a need for probing further into his later life."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Colonel Hamilton",
        "text": "One's background decides what kind of person one becomes. Would you agree with that, Skamandros?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Horn",
        "text": "I believe one has the right to choose one's own future."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Colonel Hamilton",
        "text": "Listen to that. How befitting an answer of your status."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Colonel Hamilton",
        "text": "The progeny of the Aslans' aide, first-class honors from the Royal Guard Academy, a Londinium army upstart\u2014of course you believe you can change anything and everything."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Horn",
        "text": "I have no intent to make any such changes, Colonel. You don't need to worry about our squad potentially impacting your command over County Hillock..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#6",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Colonel Hamilton",
        "text": "For a joke, I don't find that humorous at all. You can't be so arrogant as to think I'd occupy myself with a paltry little lieutenant?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#6",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Colonel Hamilton",
        "text": "I've met people like you plenty. Always all braggadocio, skin-deep, and superficial. I deigned to meet you because I wanted to tell you this\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Colonel Hamilton",
        "text": "Don't interfere in things beyond your ken."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#7",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Horn",
        "text": "I'm sorry, I cannot agree to that."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Horn",
        "text": "The orders we received were to ascertain the lost Originium products' whereabouts."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Colonel Hamilton",
        "text": "If you just stay still and wait where you ought to, then before long, you may accomplish your duty and return to Londinium with all the ostentation you'd like."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#7",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Horn",
        "text": "I don't need that ostentation of yours, and Victoria needs it even less."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#7",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Horn",
        "text": "I'm not in the routine of reporting back with a hurriedly lopped-off head, sans trial."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#7",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.3,
            "xstrength": 30,
            "ystrength": 30,
            "vibration": 30,
            "randomness": 90,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Colonel Hamilton",
        "text": "Hahah! You're telling me I've a disregard for human life\u2014and you believe those people are truly innocent? How ridiculous!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#7",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Colonel Hamilton",
        "text": "Just ten days ago, three of our soldiers were murdered in cold blood. James Cohen, Robert Boris, and Jeremy Brown."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Colonel Hamilton",
        "text": "When Cohen's wife wrote to tell him she was with a second child, she had no idea that her husband had had a hole gruesomely blown in his head."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Colonel Hamilton",
        "text": "Boris could've left this place once midsummer passed. He mentioned he'd go back to continue his family's clothiers after his retirement."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Colonel Hamilton",
        "text": "And Brown, he was a bright young student just a year ago, and not even twenty when he died!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Horn",
        "text": "I give my profound regrets for their sacrifice."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Colonel Hamilton",
        "text": "Regrets! Hah, what weightless rhetoric, just like every word that wafts out of your mouth."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Horn",
        "text": "This is exactly why all of us want to catch hold of the assassinators. Colonel, on this matter, we have held unanimous positions throughout."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Colonel Hamilton",
        "text": "No one else but that Tara rabble killed them. We've uncovered two already, but I know there are still more tucked in the background."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Colonel Hamilton",
        "text": "Fifteen days ago, our barracks suffered an explosive attack at three simultaneous places. An according fifteen soldiers lost their lives. The craters and the spilled blood of our own still lie where they were."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Colonel Hamilton",
        "text": "Twenty-one days ago, our resupply transport group were ambushed outside the distribution sector in the outskirts north, and the whole detachment together with their goods disappeared without a trace. Do you feel there is any possibility they would still be alive?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Colonel Hamilton",
        "text": "This is only the last month's events, to boot. You know nothing at all of the losses we've long since endured."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Horn",
        "text": "These incidents you mention all sound very in line with the spectre force's MO."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Horn",
        "text": "In the past half a year, Londinium has continually received reports from more than ten different counties, logging up to hundreds of homicide, looting and property damage cases."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Horn",
        "text": "After every offence, they swiftly conceal their tracks, and all connected personnel who've seen them are caught in assassinations before they can contact us."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Horn",
        "text": "We've been able to obtain exceedingly little information so far."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Horn",
        "text": "That is why the lead before us is so crucial."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Horn",
        "text": "We still don't know the spectre force's goal in haunting County Hillock, but I believe that they are our mutual enemy."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Horn",
        "text": "Colonel, if we and the barracks can cooperate, and uncover the spectre force here, it'll be of great benefit to County Hillock and Victoria as a whole."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Colonel Hamilton",
        "text": "Hmph. You still understand nothing at all. You treat the atrocities before you as just another case to win you a medal."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Colonel Hamilton",
        "text": "But you're wrong, soldier. This is not some case, and no such true culprit exists. This is a war, and it is between us and them, a war ongoing for decades, even for centuries."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Colonel Hamilton",
        "text": "You call them a spectre force, but do you know what that name signifies?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Colonel Hamilton",
        "text": "Who is the enemy we've been confronting all this time? Well?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Colonel Hamilton",
        "text": "It's a ghost! It's a phantom drifting over this city, an apparition that echoes in the heads of Taran morons, it is a life-in-spirit ghost!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Colonel Hamilton",
        "text": "And that spectre speaks a different language to us, willfully distorts the history molded by our ancestors' hands, has delusions that by the body of our city it will one day return to life!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Horn",
        "text": "Are you saying that a great amount of the local populace are supporters of the spectre force?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#6",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Colonel Hamilton",
        "text": "Great amount? Supporters? No, you're mistaken. They are one single whole."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Colonel Hamilton",
        "text": "Have you ever read this anthology of poetry?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Horn",
        "text": "Seamus Williams. His poems have some fame in Londinium too."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Colonel Hamilton",
        "text": "This is their very compilation of bare-faced lies about Victoria. In their depictions, they have their own language; they are this land's natural owners."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Horn",
        "text": "Still, Victoria can tolerate the mindsets of authors who come from differing cultural backgrounds."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Colonel Hamilton",
        "text": "No one would assume a dreamer's fantasy as their truth. Not unless that dream mentioned taking up a hatchet. Not unless it was about wanting to cut our heads off."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Colonel Hamilton",
        "text": "I still keep this book of an idiot's sleeptalk so that the bloodstains upon it always remind me\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Colonel Hamilton",
        "text": "If one lives on Victoria's land, yet refuses to give one's own name in Victorian, then one is no longer a Victorian, but an enemy and a menace to this country's safety!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#7",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.5,
            "xstrength": 15,
            "ystrength": 15,
            "vibration": 20,
            "randomness": 70,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Horn",
        "text": "You... you executed the holder of this anthology? Simply because they..."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_241",
            "fadetime": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier",
        "text": "Reporting in!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_227_1#1",
